.TH ALI-UPDATE-VERSION 1 "October 2026" "ALI Linux 1.4.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ali-update-version \- in-place ALI-layer upgrade, no reinstall
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ali-update-version \-\-check
.I target
.br
.B ali-update-version
.I target
.SH DESCRIPTION
Moves the ALI layer to tag vTARGET from GitHub: rebuilds the C
apps, installs scripts, units and desktops, stamps the version.
.B \-\-check
only reports what would change. The Debian base is separate;
see
.BR ali-update (1).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ali-update (1),
.BR ali-mirrors (1)
